## Tech Stack

| Component | Tool |
|---|---|
| Language | Python |
| Document parsing | python-docx |
| Orchestration | LangChain |
| Embeddings | sentence-transformers (`all-MiniLM-L6-v2`) |
| Vector store | Qdrant |
| Generation | Groq |
| Frontend | Streamlit |
| Evaluation | Custom scripts + hand-written golden set |

